<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line" lang="ru">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document" lang="en">Advancing Jailbreak Strategies: A Hybrid Approach to Exploiting LLM Vulnerabilities and Bypassing Modern Defenses</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author" lang="en">
<span class="ltx_personname">Mohamed Ahmed
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
